{unmattabhairavahṛdayam}

|| śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ ||

oṃ namaḥ śivāya ||

om unmattabhairavāya namaḥ ||

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtirūvāca (-)

śrṇu rudra mahābhāga kāruṇi puruṣottamaḥ |
unmattabhairavo yantradhāraṇo buddhimatācchṛṇu || 1 ||

liṅgākāraṃ lakṣmībījaṃ khaṇḍaṃ bhaṅgaṃ triyugmakam |
patākāṃ pādaviṃ māyāṃ caturmārgaprakāśitām || 2 ||

parikhābhiḥ parimitāṃ koṣṭe bindusamanvitām |
ye'tra madhye śeṣarūpaṃ muṇḍapaktivirājitām || 3 ||

mahāvāsukināgena veṣṭitā vādalāñchanā |
śastraiḥ pāṣāṇa astrābhyāṃ veṣṭitai cāmarairyutā || 4 ||

nānāśastraṃ ca ghaṇṭāṃ ca vṛttadvārasamanvitām |
bhairavo nāmayantraiśca lakṣmīṃ strīṃ kāmarājitā || 5 ||

varavarṇābījayuktāṃ sadāraṃ sakalā mahān |
yete yantrāṇi bhairavyā prasiddhaṃ śaṃkara śṛṇu || 6 ||

dhārayetsādhaka śreṣṭa yaṃ likhedraktacandanaiḥ |
māraṇe śatrusaṃhāre mārjāraiḥ śoṇitairlikhet || 7 ||

<p. 2>

vaśīkaraṇakāryeṣu likhetstrīrajadhārayā |
uccāṭane ca unmāde mohane śatrupiḍite || 8 ||

sādhakai śośitai padmyāṃ tallikhedbhūrjapatrakam |
eko ācāramātrāṇāṃ validānai pṛthak pṛthak || 9 ||

māraṇe ghātayenmatsyaṃ smaśāne rajanīmukhe |
śatrusaṃhārakāle tu kṛṣṇameṣaṃ samarpayet || 10 ||

vaśīkaraṇamohanyāṃ mārjāraṃ ghātayāmi te |
uccāṭane ca unmāde sūkaraṃ ghātayāmi te || 11 ||

rātrau pūjāṃ bhairavasya yantrarājo maheśvaraḥ |
nānāmāṃsai trikhaṇḍābhi matsyamāṃsādisaṃyutām || 12 ||

pūjāṃ cakāra bhaktirvā vāñchākāmo bhavetphalam |
yaccakraṃ dhārayetsiddhiṃ maramānandasundarī || 13 ||

bālānāṃ sukhabodhāya yatrarājo mahātmanaḥ |
svacakrairparacakrairvā ḍaṃkinyādayatoṣikā || 14 ||

unmādabhaganāśārthaṃ pūjayedbhairavāya ca |
chāgaivali prayuktārai bhūtvā dhāra vāruṇim || 15 ||

anekārthaṃ yantrarājo samādhānaṃ bhavecchiva |
pūjāṃ cakāra vidhinā dadyāt cetkāraṇaṃ balim || 16 ||

iti unmattabhairavayatroddhāraḥ śubham (* * * *)
<p. 3>

|| śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ ||

om unmattabhairavāya namaḥ ||

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca (-)

kīlakaṃ nāthanāthasya trivedaṃ sayutai samā |
ṛgyajuḥ sāmavedānāṃ mantrarājo maheśvaraḥ || 1 ||

paryeṣaṇānāṃ mantrāṇāṃ divyacakṣurbhavennṛṇām |
mantrāṇāṃ vidyusāmarthā nānāmantreṣu kīlakam || 2 ||

yadvidāryai bhairavasya pātakaṃ pātakasya ca |
nānāmokṣārtha bhinnārthai bhāvābhāveṣu bhairavaḥ || 3 ||

amāvāsyāṃ caturdaśyāṃ daśamī dvādaśī tathā |
bhāvayetpūjaka śreṣṭai anurādhā virodhitām || 4 ||

māse māse pakṣa pakṣe uttamottamamaṅgalaiḥ |
vaiśākhe phālgune māghe kārtike mārgaśīṛṣayoḥ || 5 ||

anyamāsai vibhinnānāṃ pāṭhakai kṛṣṇapakṣayoḥ |
dhārābhiḥ saptamadhyeṣu bhānusomavibhinnataḥ || 6 ||

māraṇamohanaṃ caiva vaśīkaraṇatāḍanam |
uccāṭanena saṃyuktai yatpṛthak pūjayedguruḥ || 7 ||

samādhāne dhyānagamyai vaśiṣṭaimunikīlakaiḥ |
viśvāmitraiḥ kīlakañca bhāradvājau samāvisat || 8 ||

<p. 4>

tvameva kīlakaṃ siddhamamanāni kīlakam |
sarveṣāṃ kīlakaṃ kṛtya bhānucandreṇa kīlakam || 9 ||

tasmātkāruṇi he rudra nityaṃ dhāraṇakīlakam |
paṭhedvā dhārayet śreṣṭai yantrastotrai vidhānataḥ || 10 ||

etanmataṃ kīlakasya bhairavasya mahātmanaḥ |
punaḥ kavacamāhātmyaṃ vistarācchṛṇu śaṃkaraḥ || 11 ||

[iti śrī(-)unmattabhairavakīlakaṃ samāptam] | śubham |



[atha mudrā] (-)

sumukhaṃ saṃpuṭaṃ caiva vitataṃ vistaraṃ tathā |
mahāṃkuśī mahāmāsāṃ varadābhaya saṃyutām || 1 ||

matsyakūrmo varāhāṇāṃ dhenumudrā pradarśayet |
mudrā dvādaśa yatkarma kīyate kavalaṃ kṛtā || 2 || śubham

<p. 5>

|| śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ ||

om unmattabhairavāya namaḥ ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

haṃ guro jagatāṃ nātha trailokyabhārgavaḥ kaviḥ |
brahmarṣimuniśārdūla tatrarājo ṛṣeśvaraḥ || 1 ||

unmattabhairavo dhīmān nāmnāmāścaryarūpiṇaḥ |
nirlajjo paramānanda ghorarūpo bhayaṃkaraḥ || 2 ||

tasyotpatti tataḥ kāryaṃ kāraṇe kiṃ prakāśikā |
śrotumicchāmi he nātha tatpacāṃgaṃ phalaṃ samāḥ || 3 ||

kathayāmi prasanno'smi kathaṃ conmattaḥ bhairavāḥ |
yatra mantrādi tantrāṇāṃ kiṃ kiṃ kāle praviśyatām || 4 ||

niḥśeṣo vadatāṃ nātha śiṣyaṃ dṛṣṭvā prasannatāḥ |
iti vaditvā lokeśaḥ sthitvāgre gurusannidhau || 5 ||

añjaliṃ baddhayāmāsa praṇamya ca muhurmuhuḥ |
jagaccailokyaguruṇā prasannaṃ bhavati kṣaṇāt || 6 ||

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca (-)

śṛṇu śiṣya mahābuddhe devānāṃ devapūjitā |
bhaktisaṃtoṣikāvākyaṃ dhanyo māṃ bhavaśevakāḥ || 7 ||

paramānanda connatyā dhīmān cittaṃ bhavatkṛtā |
nāmāni dvādaśākhyāni ādau śṛṇu maheśvaraḥ || 8 ||

<p. 6>

om asya śrīparamānandamūrti conmattabhairava dvādaśanāmāni mūlamantrasya 
nemunyādi ṛṣiḥ ṛgyajuḥ sāmāthavāṇi gāyatrī chandaḥ śrī unmattabhairavo devatā 
oṃ paramānanda bījaṃ conmattaḥ śaktiḥ bhīmaḍākinyādi saṃhārakīlakaṃ 
madhumāṃsādi vyatirikta caturvidhapuruṣārtha siddhaye jape viniyogaḥ ||

oṃ hrīm aṅguṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ oṃ paramānanda hrīṃ tarjanibhyāṃ svāhā ||
oṃ unmattabhairavo devatā madhyamābhyāṃ vaṣaṭ |
oṃ ḍākinyādi doṣanivāraṇāya hūm anāmikābhyāṃ hūṃ ||
oṃ nirlajjo bhīṣaṇamūrtaye kaniṣṭikābhyāṃ vauṣaṭ ||
oṃ hrīṃ hrīṃ paramāndamūrtaye praṃ praṃ praṃ mama lavarayīṃ hrīṃ 
unmattabhairavāya hūṃ karatalakarapṛṣṭābhyāṃ phaṭ | evaṃ hṛdayādi nyāsān kṛtvā 
|| daṇḍavatpraṇamet ||

om unmattaṃ prathamaṃ nāma dvitīyaṃ bhairavam tathā ||

tṛtīyaṃ bhīmarūpā ca caturthaṃ yoginīpatiḥ || 9 ||

pañcamaṃ mātṛkānāthaṃ nirlajjo caiva ṣaṭamam |
saptamaṃ paramānandamaṣṭamamaṣṭabhairavāḥ || 10 ||

<p. 7>

navamaṃ gaṇanāthaṃ ca daśamaṃ ḍākinī hataḥ |
ghora ekādaśaṃ nāma dvādaśā sātvikī samā || 11 ||

eta dvādaśanāmāni unmatta bhairavo haraḥ |
hṛdayaṃ tatpravakṣyāmi śṛṇu śiṣya maheśvaraḥ || 12 ||

hariḥ oṃ tatsat pārameśvaratantre vārāṇasī paṭale śrī(-)unmatta bhairavopākhyāne 
gururudrasaṃvāde śrī(-)unmattabhairavastotraṃ śubham || 2972 ||

om unmattabhairavāya namaḥ || śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

unmattabhairavo dhīmān tasya vai hṛdayaṃ śṛnu | 
vaktuṃ rahasyaṃ deveśa kathayāmi hara tvayā || 1 ||

manovāñchā bhavetsiddhi hṛdayaṃ bharavasya ca |
mantreṇa sahito rudra bhairavotpatti sarvadā || 2 ||

purākalpe samudbhūte hari bauddhasvarūpa dhṛk |
tasya śaktirviruddhāṅgī loke santānanāśinī || 3 ||

putra tṛtīyaṃ teṣāṃ vai sutā strī tasya ḍaṃkini |
nāmnā pṛthak pṛthak rudra trailokyaśiśunāśakāḥ || 4 ||

dhūmramātaṅginī buddhā bauddharakṣākarotu me |
ḍaṃkinyā jyeṣṭhaputrasya nāmnā bhūddhūmralocanaḥ || 5 ||

<p. 8>

dhānyamāli jyeṣṭaputrī dhūmrabījaṃ kaniṣṭikā |
dhūmrinī tadbhaginyā vai vakabandhakaniṣṭakaḥ || 6 ||

vyaṃkatiti bhravaṇānte śṛṇu nāmāni ṣaṭ śṛṇu |
mātṛbhyāṃ sahito saptalokenāsaṃti santatim || 7 ||

brāhmaṇān kṣatriyān vaiśyān putraputrīṣu pīḍitā |
tasmātkāruṇya he rudra bhavānunmattarūpadhṛk || 8 ||

nirlajjo nirahaṃkāro svābhāvaṃ rahita tvayā |
na jānāmi prakāreṇa śṛṇo ātmamāṃ pure || 9 ||

māyātītaṃ jagatsarvaṃ bhavānmāyāsamudbhavaḥ |
śṛṇu śiṣya bhavallīlā mahātmo mattabhairavaḥ || 10 ||

om asya śrī conmattabhairava hṛdaya mūlamantrasya vyāghravadana bhairava ṛṣiḥ 
śārdūladvandvaḥ śrī(-)unmattabhairavo devatā rāṁ rāṁ rāṁ laṁ vaṁ bījaṃ trāṁ trāṁ trāṁ eṁ 
huṁ huṁ huṁ hā hā hā śaktiḥ mānuṣī śaṃkaṣṭanāśana kīlakaṃ caturvidha puruṣārtha 
siddhyarthe ḍākinyādi doṣanivāraṇārthe jape viniyogaḥ ||

oṁ rāṁ phrūṁ pamalavarayīṁ pūrvamūrtaye namaḥ || huṁ ||

oṁ tāṁ aiṁ amalavarayīṁ āgneya mūrtaye namaḥ || huṁ ||

oṁ āṁ jaṁ kamalavarayīṁ ānandamūrtaye jrūṁ yamamūrtaye namaḥ || huṁ ||

oṁ taḥ taḥ taḥ trīṁ trīṁ tamalavarayīṁ naiṁ nairṛtamūrtaye namaḥ || huṁ ||

<p. 9>

oṁ vrāṁ vāhane vrūṁ vamalavarayīṁ varuṇamūrtaye namaḥ || huṁ ||

oṁ maṁ mārute mraiṁ mraiṁ mamalavarayīṁ mahānubhāvamūrtaye marutamūrtaye namaḥ || 
huṁ ||

oṁ kraṁ kraṁ kraṁ kā kā kā kāruṇi kuhu kuhu kuhu hrīṁ dhamalavarayīṁ dhaḥ 
dhaneśvaramūrtaye namaḥ ||

huṁ īṁ īśānamūrtaye phaṭ manmātamūrtaye īṁ bhamalavarayīṁ paśupataye hrīṁ 
īśānamūrtaye namaḥ || huṁ ||

oṁ tejasāṃ pataye namo namo ākāśāt śrīṁ hrīṁ akasalavarīṁ āṁ ākāśamūrtaye namaḥ 
|| huṃ ||

oṃ adho āntari kṣreṁ kalaśrīṁ (*?) antarīkṣaṃ antarīkṣamūrtaye namaḥ || huṃ ||

oṁ bhrūṁ adha bhamalavara hūṃ adhamūrtaye namaḥ huṁ ||

oṁ ḍākinyā dalanāśakā varūthitā sānandamūrti jaṭāsvabhāvaṃ rahite 
sadāśivapriyāṃ nānātvamūrtidharā || nārācyaṃ naṃṭinā praṇaumi satataṃ 
mālolapiṅgairjaṭā nirlajjā bhayanāśakā surapate vārāhi kānto haraḥ ||

iti ādi ādidhyānam atha ṣoḍhānyāsaḥ ||

oṁ śīṁ śamalavarayīṃ śirase svāhā ||
oṁ śīṁ śikhābhyāṃ samalavarayīṁ svāhā ||
oṁ bhrāṁ bhamalavarayīṁ bhṛṁ bhṛkuṭibhāle svāhā |
oṁ trāṁ trāṁ dakṣiṇe nānārasabhakṣiṇe damalavarayīṁ dakṣiṇe nāśikāya svāhā ||
oṁ trāṁ trāṁ vāme vrūṁ vamalavarayīṁ vāmanāśikāya svāhā ||

<p. 10>

oṃ kaṁ kaṁ kaṁ kamalavarayīṁ krāṁ dakṣiṇakarṇāya svāhā ||
oṁ kraṁ kraṁ kraṁ kamalavarayīṁ kaḥ kuru vāmakarṇāya svāhā ||
oṃ vāk vrūṁ vrūṁ vamalavarayīṁ vāk dvārāya svāhā ||
oṁ kaṁ kaṇṭhāya kamalavarayīṁ kaṇṭhāya svāhā ||
oṁ hrāṁ hrāṁ hrāṁ hamalavarayīṁ kṣmrīṁ hrīṁ hṛdayāya svāhā ||
oṁ yamalavarayīṁ udare svāhā ||
oṁ nāṁ nāmnīṁ ramaradhamalahīṁ nābhimūrtaye svāhā ||
oṁ liṁ liṅgaṃ lamalavarahrīṁ liṁ liṅgāya svāhā ||
oṁ jrāṁ jrāṁ nuṃ jruṁ jamalavarahrīṁ daṃ dakṣiṇajaṃghāya svāhā ||
oṁ vrāṁ vrīṁ vrāṁ jrāṁ jānuṃ huṁ jamalavarahrīṁ vrāṁ vāmajaṃghāya svāhā ||
oṁ prāṁ drūṁ dakṣiṇaghamalatarīṃ dakṣiṇapādāya svāhā ||
oṁ prāṁ prīṁ drūṁ lamalavarayīṁ vāmapādāya svāhā ||
oṁ aiṁ aiṁ aiṁ amalavarahrīṁ aṅguṣṭābhyāṃ namaḥ ||
oṁ āṁ āṁ āṁ taḥ taḥ taḥ tamalavarahrīṁ tarjanibhyāṃ namaḥ ||
oṁ  hrūṁ  hrūṁ hrūṁ mrīṁ mrīṁ mamalavarahrīṁ madhyamābhyāṃ namaḥ ||
oṁ kaṁ khaṁ gaṁ ghaṁ ṅaṁ āṁ āṁ amalavarahrīṁ anāmikābhyāṃ namaḥ ||
oṁ krāṁ krīṁ krūṁ kraiṁ krauṁ kraḥ karalavarahīṁ kaṃ kaniṣṭhikābhyāṃ namaḥ ||
samādhānaṃ hraiṃ aṁ samadhalaravadhrīṁ kāṁ hūṁ karatalakarapṛṣṭābhyāṃ namaḥ oṁ 
hrīṁ hramalavarayīṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ ||

<p. 11>

oṁ aiṁ śrīṁ śamalavarayīṁ śīṁ śirase svāhā oṁ samalavaradhrīṁ śaṁ śikhāyai vaṣaṭ ||
oṁ krāṁ krīṁ kavacalavarahīṁ oṁ kavacāya hum oṁ (* * * * * * * * * * *) kaniṣṭikābhyāṃ 
vauṣaṭ ||

oṁ phaṭ (3) hā (5) hrīṁ amalavarayadhrīṁ oṁ astrāya phaṭ ||

oṁ saṁ sāṁ samalavaradhrīṁ sarvāṅgamūrtaye svāhā ||

oṁ śrīṁ śrīṁ śramalavarahrīṁ śrī(-)unmatta ānandamūrti nāmā mamalavarayīṁ rakṣa rakṣa 
digbandhanam ||

oṁ bhrāṁ bhairavāya kara adhakara pṛṣṭābhyāṃ namaḥ oṁ ānanda mūrtaye 
svabhāvarahitāya kaniṣṭikābhyāṃ namaḥ oṁ vrāṁ vārāhi pataye vrūṁ 
anāmikābhyāṃ namaḥ ||

oṁ aṁ aghoramūrtaye mūrtaye ghrūṁ maṁ madhyamābhyāṃ namaḥ ||
oṁ hūṁ ḍākinyā mānanāśakāya hūṁ taṁ tarjanibhyāṃ namaḥ ||
oṁ adbhutākāramūrtaye sarvabhayabhañjanāya aṃguṣṭhābhyā namaḥ ||
oṁ bhūtapretapiśācanāśanāya bhayabhañjanāya dikpālāya hrīṁ digbandhanam ||

phaṭ hūṁ bhairavanāthāya astrāya phaṭ ||
dvādaśavāhave bāhudharāya sarve hrīṁ arimarddanāya huṃ kavacāya hum |
nānāmūrtaye mraṁ mrūṁ dīrghacchandasi śirase svāhā ||
iti nyāsaḥ

<p. 12>

vande jvālamayopate suraguruṃ nānṛtya mātṛpate sānandābhayabhañjitāharapriyāṃ 
ṣaṭ huṃ yugmaṃ priyāṃ (* *) ||

vārāhī dhṛtavānasāṃ paśupati ḍākinyavidhvaṃsitā vande mattaharaṃ bhayaṃ 
bhuvaravaṃ natvā guruṃ bhairavam ||

iti dhyānam

oṁ śrīṁ unmattabhairavāya vidmahe svabhāvarahitāya dhīmahī bhavān rudraḥ pracodayāt 
||

oṁ bhīmeśvarāya vidmahe lambakaṇāya dhīmahi māna indraḥ pracodayāt ||

oṃ hrīṁ ānandāya vidmahe ratnamukuṭāya dhīmahī lajjāhīnaḥ pracodayāt || iti gāyatrī 
||

atha mūlamantraḥ

oṁ aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ unmattabhairavo huṃphaṭ duṣṭaḍākinī tejaṃ nāśaya mamābhayaṃ kuru 
(2) huṁ ḍākinīṃ māraya māraya svāhā ||

catvāri sambhavānmantragāyatrī sahitena ca |
japtvāraṇye śmaśāne vā kṣetre vārāṇasīthavā || 1 ||

aśītilakṣya japtvā vān cittāmaṇi bhavettaraḥ |
muktāpravālai rudrākṣai phaṭikākṣaistathottamaiḥ || 2 ||

<p. 13>

uttamo hemaguṭikā madhyamo rajatāṃ guṭiḥ |
mālābhiḥ śṛṇu śiṣyatvaṃ granthitā ūrṇasūtrayaḥ || 3 ||

gomukhī tu parimitā kṛṣṇavarṇottamottamāḥ |
ūrṇāpavitravastrāṅgam āsanaṃ sādhakaiḥ śṛṇu || 4 ||

uttamo naracarma syāttadantahastilāñchanā |
vyāghracarmo madhyamārasyādadhamo mṛgacarmaṇā || 5 ||

pūjāvidhānaṃ he rudra śṛṇu vistarato bhavān |
sādhakebhyo naraśreṣṭa kartavyaṃ bhairavasya ca || 6 ||

jalamānīya gaṅgāyā sakalpa vidhipūrvakam |
pūjāṃ cakāra bhīmasya ardharātreṣu uttamāḥ || 7 ||

ekākī śiṣyasahitā varadhūpaṃ praśasyatām |
śrīkhaṇḍacandanairyuktāṃ raktacandana saṃyutām || 8 ||

sindūrai śrīñca saṃyuktāṃ nānāgandhānulepanām |
dṛṣṭirpatākāsaṃyuktāṃ nānāvastrasamākulām || 9 ||

cākṣatairkṛṣṇavarṇābhāṃ yavaiśca tilasaṃyutām |
kṛṣṇasūtropavītāṅgāṃ navatantu samanvitām || 10 ||

puṣpai nānāvicitrāṅgāṃ sugandhāṃ sumanoharām |
japākaṅkolamālatyā pārijātādirañjitām || 11 ||

<p. 14>

niṃvosāramayi sudhāṃ sugandhāmatasārasām |
candrādityamayo rūpāṃ tejomūrtimanoharām || 12 ||

kāñcanaiḥ saṃyutāṃ divyāṃ dhūpadīpaiḥ samanvitām |
pūjāṃ kṛtvā bhīmarūpaṃ bhairavaṃ bhojanaṃ dade || 13 ||

nānāpakvānnasaṃyuktairnānārasa samanvitaiḥ |
sakkṛccārpayate deva naivedyam arpitā haraḥ || 14 ||

phalai nānā ikṣudaṇḍanāraṅgaiḥ kadalīphalaiḥ |
āmrai madhurasairyuktairnaivedyaṃ bhānurīśvaraḥ || 15 ||

tarpaṇaimadhuronmattai hrīṃ bījaistrividhairasaiḥ |
karpūrairarpitādeva arghyaṃ dadyāt payo'mṛtaiḥ || 16 ||

pūgīphalaiśca tābūlai khādirādimanoharaiḥ |
suvarṇaṃ rajataṃ tāmraṃ dakṣiṇāṃ cārpayetkila || 17 ||

atha puṣpāñjalistotraṃ madhupānaya bhojanam |
cakāra vidhivatpūjāmācāryaṃ copalabhyatām || 18 ||

oṁ namo rudrāya devāya satvanāṃ pataye namaḥ |
bhavāya narasiṃhāya unmattāya namo namaḥ || 19 ||

bhairavo lokanāthāya lokānāṃ pataye namaḥ |
namaḥ strailokya nāthāya satvanāṃ pataye namaḥ || 20 ||

<p. 15>

iti paṭhitvā lājā ca pūrtaye tat gulālakaiḥ |
guggulairvyāptayedhūpaṃ japaṃ vidhividhānataḥ || 21 ||

oṃkāro śivabhakti syāttrailokyaṃ vyāptayo jagat |
aiṃkāro kāmarāja syātkāmānusāra saṃyutām || 22 ||

bhairavī saṃyutāṃ bījaṃ bhairavīṁ vyāptayo jagat |
hrīṃ māyāmātṛkābījaṃ devagṛhasamanvitām || 23 ||

hrīṃ bījairiti mantreṣu gauryādivyāptayo jagat |
ukāro viśvakartā ca viśveśvara praśasyatām || 24 ||

lakṣmībījādikaṃ vyāptaṃ mahālakṣmī praṇamyatām |
mahālakṣmī jagadbījaṃ sakalaṃ vyāptayo jagat || 25 ||

nakāraśca makāraśca viṣṇurindro vasetsukham |
tataḥ sarve kumārābhyāṃ aśvinīmaravaidyayo || 26 ||

bhaṃ bījai bhayahartā ca svayaṃ bhairavabhānumān |
aiṃkārasahitai bījai bhayai bhaikāramucyate || 27 ||

ravijaṃ ravirūpatvaṃ vabījaṃ varuṇastathā |
oṃkārasahito bīja vokāro dvandvayugmakam || 28 ||

<p. 16>

huṃ krodhairasitāṅgaistu anusvārasamanvitai |
da(-)uvarṇau prasaṅgānāṃ dukāraḥ yoginīḥ svayam || 29 ||

sakārañca takārañca saṃyojyaṃ yugmavarṇayoḥ |
bhavāṃ māyāṃ ca sahitaṃ takāraiśca svayaṃ śivaḥ || 30 ||

āṁ bījaiḥ sahitāṃ baddhāṃ dakāramātṛkā svayam |
ikāro sahito vargo ādivargaiḥ sarasvatīḥ || 32 ||

īkārasahitai vargāḥ nakāro bījamuttamāḥ |
catuḥ samudrāṃ saṃyuktāṃ vāribījaṃ nikārakaḥ || 32 ||

tavargabījaṃ ekārasahitairinduvāsikāḥ |
indurūpasvayam brahmā brāhmaṇo nṛpasattamāḥ || 33 ||

aiṃkārabīja uktāmān akārasahitaṃ mudā |
javargasaṃyutāṃ puṇyāṃ jayamaṅgalasaṃyutām || 34 ||

ākāraiḥ sahitāṃ vaddhā navargo nṛtyadaivatā |
sakārasundarī devī yakāro caiva pārvatī || 35 ||

makāraṃ ca mahālakṣmī mākāro kālikāstathā |
bhakāro bhayahartā ca yakāra bhairavī smṛtā || 36 ||

kubījaṃ caiva unmattaṃ rūṃ bījaṃ lalitāstathā |
huṃ bījaṃ niḥsvabhāvaṃ ca kāmarūdrastathaiva ca || 37 ||

<p. 19>

hūṃ hūṃ varṇaiśca saṃyuktāṃ pūrvo para tathaiva ca |
ḍākāro ḍākinī vargaikikāra kiṃkiṇī tathā || 38 ||

nivarṇai kṣetrapālaiśca te kāro parameśvaraḥ |
mā mṛtyuramayāṃ kāntādvandvavarṇaprayatnataḥ || 39 ||

mākāraiśca mākālīrīkāro bhīmabhairavaḥ |
yakāro yamabhaktāśca vahnijāyāḥ praṇamyatām || 40 ||

kāśināthaṃ ramānāthaṃ yadunāthaṃ namāmyaham |
śrīmahābhairavonmattau svabhārarahitaṃ svayam || 42 ||

hāhākārai homa dhūpai huhu śabdastathaiva ca |
sākhyayogai pānapātrai muṇḍamālāvirājitai || 42 ||

khaḍgakhaṭvāṅgapāśaṃ ca vajraṃ ghaṭāmbikāpatim |
nāgabūṣaṇa śobhāḍhyāṃ nāgakuṇḍalaśobhitām || 43 ||

nāgahāravibhūṣāḍhyāṃ vyāghracarmottarīyakam |
pāṇau kātyāyanīrudrāṃ vāruṇīṃ varuṇādhipām || 44 ||

cāmuṇḍāpataye tubhyaṃ vārāhīpataye namaḥ |
caṇḍikāpataye tubhyaṃ brahmāṇīpataye namaḥ || 45 ||

vaiṣṇavīpataye tubhyaṃ namastrailokyaśaṃkara |
kaumārī jyeṣṭhabhātrātvaṃ namonmattaiva bhairavaḥ || 46 ||

<p. 18>

indrāṇī vajrahastā tvaṃ indrāṇīpataye namaḥ |
cāmuṇḍāpataye tubhyaṃ nātha trailokya bhairavaḥ || 47 ||

vijayādaśamīnāthaṃ rogahantrī harāmyaham |
hārākācanavarṇābhāṃ sātvikī rājasī tathā || 48 ||

iti vāgguruṇā vākyaṃ śrutvā śaṃkara śāmbavaḥ |
hṛdayaṃ bhairavo nātha vārāṇasyonmattabhairavaḥ || 49 ||

sāṅgaṃ hṛdayamunmattaṃ yo naraḥ paṭhyate sadā |
vāñchitā labhate siddhi nānāpīḍāṃ samākulām || 50 ||

grahabhūtādijantūnāṃ ḍākinī doṣanāśakam |
kāmākṣāṃ cintidā nityāṃ hṛdaye dhārayetsadā || 51 ||

vidyārthī cāpnuyādvidyāṃ dhanārthī labhate dhanam |
mokṣārthī labhate mokṣaṃ siddhyarthī siddhimāpnuyāt || 52 ||

trikāle paṭhate nityaṃ śmaśāne śivamandire |
japitvā rajanīmantrai hṛdayaṃ bhairavasya ca || 53 ||

kīlakaṃ tatpravakṣyāmi yantroddhāraṃ samākula |
bhavānkṛtyekacitte bho vistarādvatatāmaham || 54 ||

[hariḥ oṃ tatsatpārameśvaratantre vārāṇasī paṭale unmattabhairavopākhyāne 
gururudrasaṃvāde śrī(-)unmatta bhairavahṛdayaṃ samāptam] | śubham ||

